+# #1537 (1): one DeviceIDs entry may be comma-joined — Compose expands
+# `device_ids: ["${ESTATE_GPUS}"]` into DeviceIDs ["2,3"], not ["2","3"]. Treated
+# as one selector it matches no nvidia-smi row, and the card listed every GPU on
