+# #1537 (3): --spec-label reads the drafter from the engine, not from Cmd. The
+# vLLM boot line is at the HEAD of the logs (5000 request lines follow it — a
+# tail read, the old detect-kv style, would find only filler).
+S_STUB="$(mktemp -d)"
